<metadata><name>Newport Cup - Around Conanicut Island</name><desc>Around Conanicut Island (Newport Cup NOR). North gate = red Bell 2 (vs CYC&#x27;s green Can 3). Start/finish RC line, East Passage. Newport Bridge center span; no sailing Rose I.-Newport Bridge. Start/finish per 2026 SI 5.1: RC boat anchored west of Goat Island, east of the shipping channel (position approximate). Course P added from SI 4.7; course Z not drawn until its G 17 is confirmed.</desc></metadata>
